# Design notes kept local, not published.
#
# OPTIMIZATION.md is a working document: it records the exploratory discussion,
# rejected options, measured colour tables and the bug post-mortems that led
# here. That is useful to whoever maintains the plugin and noise to everyone
# else, so it stays out of the repository. The durable conclusions live in
# README.md; if a design decision ever needs its reasoning recorded publicly,
# it belongs there rather than in a resurrected copy of the notes.
OPTIMIZATION.md
